#. of a slide, and the largest it can be.
#: app/src/save_copy.rs:253
msgid "The copy would be {width} × {height} pixels; at most {max} per side."
msgstr ""
"La copia sarebbe di {width} × {height} pixel; il massimo è {max} per lato."

#. Translators: shown as a sentence on its own: the size of the copy
#. of a slide, and the smallest it can be.
#: app/src/save_copy.rs:261
msgid ""
"The copy would be {width} × {height} pixels; it must be at least {min} × "
